          "when": [
            "!flag:smith_done"
          ],
          "text": "\"Another one off the coast road? Garran. This is my forge, such as it is. No ore's come up the road in months, but I've a few bars put by. Make something. First one's on me.\""
        },
        {
          "when": [
            "flag:smith_done"
          ],
          "text": "\"Forge is hot. Iron's three coppers a bar. Anything you make, you keep.\""
